title: "Predator-Prey Archetype Gridworld Environment"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-07-27"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ProValarous/PPAGE-Predator-Prey-Archetype-Gridworld-Environment"
url: "https://provalarous.github.io/PPAGE-Predator-Prey-Archetype-Gridworld-Environment/"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic, modular multi-agent predator-prey gridworld testbed for
  controlled MARL experiments. Pluggable observation, reward, and action-space
  systems sit around an immutable core, with reproducibility enforced by
  construction so that ablation studies isolate exactly one changed variable
  at a time.
